---
layout: base.njk
---
{% set c = campaigns["south-brunswick"] %}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">South Brunswick, New Jersey</p>
    <h1>Stop the data center at 4405 Route 1</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ c.summary }}</p>
    <p class="lede">We're neighbors organizing to stop it, because it's moving forward without enforceable limits or a real public voice, and to make sure every official's position is on the record.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/south-brunswick/">Get the facts</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/officials/">Where officials stand</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="mission">
    <h2>Why we're here</h2>
    <p>Large projects with serious environmental, health and financial impacts should be decided in public. We don't oppose data centers or AI. We oppose building them in our neighborhoods without enforceable limits on noise, emissions, water and power costs, and without giving residents a real voice.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <h2>What you can do now</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    {% for a in c.actions %}
    <div class="card{% if a.until %} timely{% endif %}"{% if a.until %} data-until="{{ a.until }}"{% endif %}>
      <h3>{{ a.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ a.text | mdInline | safe }}</p>
      <a class="btn small" href="{{ a.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ a.button }}</a>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <h2>Follow and get involved</h2>
  <ul class="follow">
    {% for s in site.social %}
    <li><a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="noopener"><strong>{{ s.name }}</strong> {{ s.label }}</a></li>
    {% endfor %}
    <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"><strong>Email</strong> {{ site.email }}</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted small-print">South Brunswick is the first campaign of Stop NJ Data Centers.</p>
</section>
